  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stonewall Out Of The Margins Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Out of the Margins aims to promote and protect rights for Lesbian, Bi Women, and Trans (LBT+) communities across the world through strengthening global capability of LBT+ civil society to deliver impactful and coordinated global responses to mitigate threats posed by the anti-rights movement, preventing roll back of LBT+ rights, and ensuring their ongoing inclusion within the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development, particularly supporting Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) 3, 5 and 16.</narrative>
  </description>
